  "updated": "2026-05-12",
  "editorialHtmlEn": "<p>Ordering follows Data.ai / Sensor Tower style global charts — regional super-apps are listed below.</p><p>“Digital life” here means maps, rides, media, wallets, and travel conveniences — not telemedicine or clinical diagnosis. For health decisions, talk to a licensed professional and read each vendor’s own safety copy.</p><p>Last reviewed: <strong>2026-05-19</strong>. Period-tracking and fertility apps may appear in “more”; they are not medical devices on this page.</p>",
  "editorialHtmlZh": "<p>顺序参考 Data.ai、Sensor Tower 一类「全球用户量」榜单；地区性超级应用放在「更多」里。</p><p>本页的「数字生活」边界是地图、出行、影音、钱包、旅行等日常工具，<strong>不包含</strong>在线诊疗或诊断建议。健康相关请以持牌医疗机构与各应用内说明为准。</p><p>最近核对：<strong>2026-05-19</strong>。「更多」里可能出现生理期类应用，仅作生活工具入口，不在此页作医疗器械表述。</p>",
  "rankTitleEn": "Global top 10 (digital life)",
  "rankTitleZh": "全球前十（数字生活）",
  "rankLeadEn": "Apps that routinely top global MAU / install charts for everyday cross-border use — not an exhaustive directory of every local super-app.",
