  "newsTitleEn": "App essentials",
  "newsTitleZh": "应用常用入口",
  "newsLeadEn": "Download pages, help centers, and flagship features for each service — all on the vendor’s own site.",
  "newsLeadZh": "以下为各应用官网上的下载、帮助说明、热门功能或场景入口（如地图导航与探索）；请以各站最新页面为准。",
  "moreTitleEn": "China & regional apps",
  "moreTitleZh": "国内与地区常用应用",
